{"url": "https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/36521.Deborah_Leblanc", "name": "Deborah Leblanc", "genres": ["Paranormal", "Mystery & Thrillers", "Romance"], "avgRating": 4.09, "reviewsCount": 340, "ratingsCount": 7578, "about": "Deborah LeBlanc is an award-winning, best-selling author and business owner from Lafayette, Louisiana. She is also a licensed death scene investigator, a licensed private investigator and has been a paranormal investigator for over twenty years. Deborah is currently the house \u2018clairsendium\u2019 for the upcoming paranormal investigation television show, Through the Veil. She served four years as president of the Horror Writers Association, eight years as president of the Writers' Guild of Acadiana, and two years as president of Mystery Writers of America's Southwest Chapter. In 2007, Deborah founded Literacy Inc. a non-profit organization dedicated to fighting illiteracy in America\u2019s teens. For more information, visit www.deborahleblanc.com and Deborah LeBlanc is an award-winning, best-selling author and business owner from Lafayette, Louisiana. She is also a licensed death scene investigator, a licensed private investigator and has been a paranormal investigator for over twenty years. Deborah is currently the house \u2018clairsendium\u2019 for the upcoming paranormal investigation television show, Through the Veil. She served four years as president of the Horror Writers Association, eight years as president of the Writers' Guild of Acadiana, and two years as president of Mystery Writers of America's Southwest Chapter. In 2007, Deborah founded Literacy Inc. a non-profit organization dedicated to fighting illiteracy in America\u2019s teens. For more information, visit www.deborahleblanc.com and www.literacyinc.comTo support Deborah please visit https://www.patreon.com/deborahleblanc ...more"}
