{"url": "https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/3407448.Ruta_Sepetys", "name": "Ruta Sepetys", "genres": ["Young Adult", "Fiction", "Historical Fiction"], "avgRating": 4.33, "reviewsCount": 83310, "ratingsCount": 670900, "about": "#1 New York Times Bestselling Author and Winner of the Carnegie Medal.Ruta Sepetys was born and raised in Michigan in a family of artists, readers, and music lovers. The daughter of a refugee, Ruta is drawn to underrepresented stories of strength through struggle and hopes to give voice to those who weren't able to tell their story. Her award-winning historical novels are published in over sixty countries and have received over forty literary prizes.For more information:https://www.rutasepetys.comhttps://www.facebook.com/rutasepetyshttps://www.instagram.com/rutasepetys...https://www.twitter.com/rutasepetys #1 New York Times Bestselling Author and Winner of the Carnegie Medal.Ruta Sepetys was born and raised in Michigan in a family of artists, readers, and music lovers. The daughter of a refugee, Ruta is drawn to underrepresented stories of strength through struggle and hopes to give voice to those who weren't able to tell their story. Her award-winning historical novels are published in over sixty countries and have received over forty literary prizes.For more information:https://www.rutasepetys.comhttps://www.facebook.com/rutasepetyshttps://www.instagram.com/rutasepetys...https://www.twitter.com/rutasepetys ...more"}
