 is M\u00e9moires d'Hadrien, a historical novel constituting the fictionalized memoirs of that 2nd-century Roman emperor. Her works were translated by the American Grace Frick, Yourcenar\u2019s secretary and life companion. Yourcenar was also a literary critic and translator. ...more"}
