{"url": "https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/19593708.Tracy_Deonn", "name": "Tracy Deonn", "genres": ["Young Adult", "Contemporary", "Fantasy"], "avgRating": 4.33, "reviewsCount": 36705, "ratingsCount": 203021, "about": "Tracy Deonn is a writer and 2nd gen fangirl. She grew up in North Carolina, where she devoured fantasy books and Southern food in equal measure. After earning two degrees from UNC-CH, Tracy worked in live theater, video games, and K-12 education. When she\u2019s not writing, Tracy panels at SFF conventions, reads fanfic, arranges doggy playdates, and keeps an eye out for ginger-flavored everything."}
