{"url": "https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/6576110.Jodi_Ellen_Malpas", "name": "Jodi Ellen Malpas", "genres": ["Fiction", "Historical Fiction", "Romance"], "avgRating": 4.19, "reviewsCount": 36650, "ratingsCount": 485856, "about": "\u201cI write for myself. Not what I think people want to read.\u201d ~ JEM#1 New York Times &amp; Sunday Times Bestselling Author Jodi Ellen Malpas was born and raised in England, where she lives with her husband, her boys, and Theo the Doberman. Writing powerful love stories with fierce, memorable characters is her passion \u2013 a passion that has taken her on an amazing journey into the world of romantic fiction. Her work is now published in more than twenty-five languages across the world."}
