ith both US and UK governments. At one point he was qualified to say 'this isn't rocket science ... oh wait, it actually is'.Mark used to have a list of hobbies back when he did science by day. Now his time is really just divided between writing and caring for his disabled daughter. There are occasional forays into computer games too. ...more"}
