{"url": "https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/14780791.Nelou_Keramati", "name": "Nelou Keramati", "genres": ["Mystery", "Science Fiction", "Poetry"], "avgRating": 4.15, "reviewsCount": 212, "ratingsCount": 367, "about": "Nelou Keramati is a Canadian Author, Architect, Artist, and Actress. She holds a Bachelor of Arts in Psychology (B.A. Psych) and a Masters in Architecture (M.Arch) from the University of British Columbia (UBC).In 2014, her acting pursuits combined with her cognitive-behavioural background sparked an idea which she developed into a mind-bending take on Existentialism. In 2016, she debuted her theories in Resonance, the first instalment of her Sci-Fi/Mystery Thriller, The Fray Theory. Blurring the boundaries between fact and fiction, Resonance has been lauded as \u2018Science Fiction so convincing it may very well be Science Fact\u2019. In 2017, it was succeeded by The Harbinger, a novella serving as a prelude to the series.Keramati is currently workin Nelou Keramati is a Canadian Author, Architect, Artist, and Actress. She holds a Bachelor of Arts in Psychology (B.A. Psych) and a Masters in Architecture (M.Arch) from the University of British Columbia (UBC).In 2014, her acting pursuits combined with her cognitive-behavioural background sparked an idea which she developed into a mind-bending take on Existentialism. In 2016, she debuted her theories in Resonance, the first instalment of her Sci-Fi/Mystery Thriller, The Fray Theory. Blurring the boundaries between fact and fiction, Resonance has been lauded as \u2018Science Fiction so convincing it may very well be Science Fact\u2019. In 2017, it was succeeded by The Harbinger, a novella serving as a prelude to the series.Keramati is currently working on the next instalment of The Fray Theory while pursuing screenwriting and acting. ...more"}
