{"url": "https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/8361.Dorothy_Dunnett", "name": "Dorothy Dunnett", "birthDate": "1923-08-25 00:00:00", "deathDate": "2001-11-09 00:00:00", "genres": ["Mystery & Thrillers", "Historical Fiction"], "avgRating": 4.4, "reviewsCount": 4464, "ratingsCount": 54540, "about": "Dorothy Dunnett OBE was a Scottish historical novelist. She is best known for her six-part series about Francis Crawford of Lymond, The Lymond Chronicles, which she followed with the eight-part prequel The House of Niccol\u00f2. She also wrote a novel about the real Macbeth called King Hereafter and a series of mystery novels centered on Johnson Johnson, a portrait painter/spy.Her New York times obituary is here.Dorothy Dunnett Society: http://dorothydunnett.orgFansite: http://www.dorothydunnett.co.uk/ Dorothy Dunnett OBE was a Scottish historical novelist. She is best known for her six-part series about Francis Crawford of Lymond, The Lymond Chronicles, which she followed with the eight-part prequel The House of Niccol\u00f2. She also wrote a novel about the real Macbeth called King Hereafter and a series of mystery novels centered on Johnson Johnson, a portrait painter/spy.Her New York times obituary is here.Dorothy Dunnett Society: http://dorothydunnett.orgFansite: http://www.dorothydunnett.co.uk/ ...more"}
