{"url": "https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/6947727.Sara_Raasch", "name": "Sara Raasch", "genres": ["Young Adult", "Fantasy"], "avgRating": 3.84, "reviewsCount": 14966, "ratingsCount": 121806, "about": "Sara Raasch has known she was destined for bookish things since the age of five, when her friends had a lemonade stand and she tagged along to sell her hand-drawn picture books too. Not much has changed since then \u2014 her friends still cock concerned eyebrows when she attempts to draw things and her enthusiasm for the written word still drives her to extreme measures. Her debut YA fantasy, SNOW LIKE ASHES, the first in a trilogy, came out October 14, 2014 from Balzer + Bray. It does not feature her hand-drawn pictures."}
