{"url": "https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/140455.Olaudah_Equiano", "name": "Olaudah Equiano", "birthDate": "1745-01-01 00:00:00", "deathDate": "1797-03-31 00:00:00", "genres": ["Abolitionism", "Poetry", "Biographies & Memoirs"], "avgRating": 3.85, "reviewsCount": 944, "ratingsCount": 18002, "about": "Olaudah Equiano, also known as Gustavus Vassa, was one of the most prominent Africans involved in the British movement of the abolition for the slave trade. Although enslaved as a young man, he purchased his freedom and worked as an author, merchant, and explorer in South America, the Caribbean, the Arctic, the American colonies, and the United Kingdom."}
