{"url": "https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/18454.Whitley_Strieber", "name": "Whitley Strieber", "genres": ["Science Fiction & Fantasy", "Nonfiction", "Horror"], "avgRating": 3.7, "reviewsCount": 3965, "ratingsCount": 45420, "about": "American writer best known for his novels The Wolfen,The Hunger and Warday and for Communion, a non-fiction description of his experiences with apparent alien contact. He has recently made significant advances in understanding this phenomenon, and has published his new discoveries in Solving the Communion Enigma.Strieber also co-authored The Coming Global Superstorm with Art Bell, which inspired the blockbuster film about sudden climate change, The Day After Tomorrow.His book The Afterlife Revolution written with his deceased wife Anne, is a record of what is considered to be one of the most powerful instances of afterlife communication ever recorded."}
