{"url": "https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/6015512.Nancy_Omeara", "name": "Nancy Omeara", "genres": ["Philosophy", "Nonfiction"], "avgRating": 4.33, "reviewsCount": 25, "ratingsCount": 1164, "about": "NANCY OMEARA volunteered on a national religious tolerance hotline for over five years , personally answering more than 5,000 calls and helping people resolve all kinds of situations involving deep belief differences. Nancy has lived in seven different countries, and visited a dozen others, interacting with people of diverse religions, backgrounds and values. The concepts in this book stem from her personal experiences. Find out more at: authornancyomeara.com"}
