{"url": "https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/13695109.Roshani_Chokshi", "name": "Roshani Chokshi", "genres": ["Fantasy"], "avgRating": 3.91, "reviewsCount": 40544, "ratingsCount": 208692, "about": "Roshani Chokshi is the award-winning author of the New York Times bestselling series The Star-Touched Queen, The Gilded Wolves and Aru Shah and The End of Time, which Time Magazine named one of the Top 100 Fantasy Books of All Time. Her adult debut, The Last Tale of The Flower Bride, was a #1 Sunday Times bestseller. Her novels have been translated into more than two dozen languages and often draw upon world mythology and folklore. Chokshi is a member of the National Leadership Board for the Michael C. Carlos Museum and lives in Georgia with her husband and their cat whose diabolical plans must regularly be thwarted."}
