{"url": "https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/5672.Val_McDermid", "name": "Val McDermid", "birthDate": "1955-06-04 00:00:00", "genres": ["Mystery", "Crime", "Thriller"], "influences": ["Ruth Rendell", "Reginald Hill", "Norman Mailer", "Sara Paretsky", "Ernest Tidyman", "P.D.James", "Ian Rankin", "Colin Dexter", "Penelope Fitzgerald", "Harold Evans", "William McIlvanney", "James Lee Burke", "John le Carr\u00e9", "R", "Elinor M. Brent-Dyer"], "avgRating": 3.96, "reviewsCount": 28880, "ratingsCount": 343812, "about": "Val McDermid is a No. 1 bestseller whose novels have been translated into more than thirty languages, and have sold over eleven million copies. She has won many awards internationally, including the CWA Gold Dagger for best crime novel of the year and the LA Times Book of the Year Award. She was inducted into the ITV3 Crime Thriller Awards Hall of Fame in 2009 and was the recipient of the CWA Cartier Diamond Dagger for 2010. In 2011 she received the Lambda Literary Foundation Pioneer Award. She writes full time and divides her time between Cheshire and Edinburgh."}
