{"url": "https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/102473.Susan_Ware", "name": "Susan Ware", "birthDate": "1950-08-22 00:00:00", "avgRating": 3.79, "reviewsCount": 186, "ratingsCount": 1326, "about": "Susan Ware, celebrated feminist historian and biographer, is the author of American Women\u2019s History: A Very Short Introduction and Letter to the World: Seven Women Who Shaped the American Century, among other books. She is the editor of American Women\u2019s Suffrage: Voices from the Long Struggle for the Vote, 1776\u20131965 and is Honorary Women\u2019s Suffrage Centennial Historian at Radcliffe\u2019s Schlesinger Library."}
