{"url": "https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/21822333.Spencer_C_Demetros", "name": "Spencer C Demetros", "genres": ["Young Adult", "Christian", "Nonfiction"], "avgRating": 4.37, "reviewsCount": 11, "ratingsCount": 509, "about": "Spencer C. Demetros is a dad and lifelong student of Scripture. By trade, he is a business attorney in the technology industry. But in recent years, he answered God\u2019s call to use his no-nonsense but loving parental instincts, combined with his unique storytelling ability and irreverent brand of humor, to deliver God\u2019s Word in an entertaining and relatable way to young readers, wherever they are in their journeys with Christ. Spencer lives in the small New England town of Harvard, Massachusetts, with his wife, Catherine, and teenage twins. Visit him online at www.spencerdemetros.com. Spencer C. Demetros is a dad and lifelong student of Scripture. By trade, he is a business attorney in the technology industry. But in recent years, he answered God\u2019s call to use his no-nonsense but loving parental instincts, combined with his unique storytelling ability and irreverent brand of humor, to deliver God\u2019s Word in an entertaining and relatable way to young readers, wherever they are in their journeys with Christ. Spencer lives in the small New England town of Harvard, Massachusetts, with his wife, Catherine, and teenage twins. Visit him online at www.spencerdemetros.com. ...more"}
