{"url": "https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/112082.Frans_de_Waal", "name": "Frans de Waal", "birthDate": "1948-10-29 00:00:00", "deathDate": "2024-03-14 00:00:00", "genres": ["Science", "Nonfiction"], "avgRating": 4.07, "reviewsCount": 4028, "ratingsCount": 38757, "about": "Frans de Waal has been named one of Time magazine\u2019s 100 Most Influential People. The author of Are We Smart Enough to Know How Smart Animals Are?, among many other works, he is the C. H. Candler Professor in Emory University\u2019s Psychology Department and director of the Living Links Center at the Yerkes National Primate Research Center. He lives in Atlanta, Georgia."}
