{"url": "https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/2875209.T_E_Lawrence", "name": "T.E. Lawrence", "birthDate": "1888-08-16 00:00:00", "deathDate": "1935-05-19 00:00:00", "genres": ["Biographies & Memoirs"], "avgRating": 3.93, "reviewsCount": 1257, "ratingsCount": 13832, "about": "Born Thomas Edward Lawrence, and known professionally as T. E. Lawrence, though the world came to know him as Lawrence of Arabia. In 1922, Lawrence used the name John Hume Ross to enlist in the RAF; after being discovered and forced out, he took the name T. E. Shaw to join the Royal Tank Corps (1923). He was eventually let back into the RAF (1925)."}
