{"url": "https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/13414088.S_Jae_Jones", "name": "S. Jae-Jones", "genres": ["Young Adult", "Historical Fiction", "Fantasy"], "avgRating": 3.56, "reviewsCount": 8745, "ratingsCount": 44831, "about": "S. Jae-Jones, called JJ, is an artist, an adrenaline junkie, and the NYT bestselling author of Wintersong. Born and raised in Los Angeles, she now lives on the wrong coast, where she can\u2019t believe she has to deal with winter every year. When not writing, JJ can be found working toward her next black belt degree in taekwondo, being run ragged by her twin dogs, Castor &amp; Pollux, or indulging in her favorite hobby\u2014collecting more hobbies.NOTE: Only here to drop hints. \ud83d\udc40 And maybe occasionally answer questions."}
