{"url": "https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/221253.Cherie_Priest", "name": "Cherie Priest", "genres": ["Science Fiction & Fantasy", "Mystery & Thrillers", "Horror"], "avgRating": 3.72, "reviewsCount": 18862, "ratingsCount": 134051, "about": "Cherie Priest is the author of two dozen books and novellas, most recently The Toll, The Family Plot, The Agony House, and the Philip K. Dick Award nominee Maplecroft; but she is perhaps best known for the steampunk pulp adventures of the Clockwork Century, beginning with Boneshaker. Her works have been nominated for the Hugo and Nebula awards for science fiction, and have won the Locus Award (among others) \u2013 and over the years, they\u2019ve been translated into nine languages in eleven countries. Cherie lives in Seattle, WA, with her husband and a menagerie of exceedingly photogenic pets."}
