sses\u2013living in Cancun. He currently lives in Austin, Texas. ...more"}
{"url": "https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/151195.Jack_Weyland", "name": "Jack Weyland", "genres": ["Literature & Fiction", "Religion & Spirituality"], "avgRating": 3.69, "reviewsCount": 2058, "ratingsCount": 37611, "about": "Jack Weyland is the best-selling author of young-adult fiction for the Latter-day Saint market. In fact, the modern genre of Latter-day Saint-themed popular fiction is one he is largely responsible for creating with his overwhelmingly popular novel Charly. His interest in fiction began with a correspondence course in creative writing taken during a summer at BYU where he was doing research work. Since then he has published more than two dozen books, and over fifty of his short stories have been published by the LDS Church magazine The New Era.Born in Butte, Montana, Jack received a B.S. degree in physics from Montana State University and a Ph.D. in physics from BYU. Currently he teaches physics at BYU-Idaho. He formerly taught physics at th Jack Weyland is the best-selling author of young-adult fiction for the Latter-day Saint market. In fact, the modern genre of Latter-day Saint-themed popular fiction is one he is largely responsible for creating with his overwhelmingly popular novel Charly. His interest in fiction began with a correspondence course in creative writing taken during a summer at BYU where he was doing research work. Since then he has published more than two dozen books, and over fifty of his short stories have been published by the LDS Church magazine The New Era.Born in Butte, Montana, Jack received a B.S. degree in physics from Montana State University and a Ph.D. in physics from BYU. Currently he teaches physics at BYU-Idaho. He formerly taught physics at the South Dakota School of Mines and Technology.Jack and his wife, Sheryl, are the parents of five children and have four grandchildren. His hobbies include racquetball and singing. ...more"}
{"url": "https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/3407.Antony_Beevor", "name": "Antony Beevor", "birthDate": "1946-12-14 00:00:00", "genres": ["Nonfiction", "History"], "influences": ["John Keegan"], "avgRating": 4.23, "reviewsCount": 5428, "ratingsCount": 98646, "about": "Antony James Beevor is a British historian who was educated at Winchester College and Sandhurst. He studied under the famous historian of World War II, John Keegan. Beevor is a former officer with the 11th Hussars who served in England and Germany for five years before resigning his commission. He has published several popular histories on the Second World War and the 20th century in general."}
