{"url": "https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/3508354.Kelly_Keaton", "name": "Kelly Keaton", "genres": ["Young Adult", "Science Fiction & Fantasy"], "avgRating": 4.0, "reviewsCount": 2206, "ratingsCount": 26946, "about": "Kelly loves ancient history, fantasy, and mythology. She dreams of one day attaining magical powers, discovering the secret to immortality, ridding her home of pet hair, and being crowned Mardi-Gras queen. As Kelly Gay, she writes the popular adult urban fantasy series, Charlie Madigan, for Pocket Books. While she calls Raleigh, NC, home, she can also be found chatting about books and life on Facebook and Twitter."}
