{"url": "https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/7734428.Karen_Lynch", "name": "Karen  Lynch", "genres": ["Young Adult", "Paranormal", "Fantasy"], "avgRating": 4.39, "reviewsCount": 6939, "ratingsCount": 88709, "about": "Karen Lynch is a New York Times and USA Today bestselling author. She grew up in Newfoundland, Canada - a place rich in colorful people and folklore to which she attributes her love of the supernatural and her vivid imagination. She moved to Charlotte, North Carolina years ago and was immediately charmed by the southern people but she says she will always be a newfie.Though she loves supernatural fiction, she has a soft spot for Charlotte Bront\u00eb and Jane Austin. She is a fan of classic rock, country and classical music but her favorite music is the sound of a good thunderstorm or a howling blizzard. Two of her favorite past times are baking artisan breads for her friends and spending quality time with her two German Shepherds."}
