{"url": "https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/63195.Ruby_Gupta", "name": "Ruby Gupta", "genres": ["Mystery", "Fiction", "Thriller"], "avgRating": 4.43, "reviewsCount": 227, "ratingsCount": 311, "about": "Based amidst the misty Himalayan foothills, Ruby Gupta is the best-selling author of nine books. She has been honoured as the International Writer-in-Residence at the International Agatha Christie Festival (2022) in Torquay, Devon, England. A double gold medallist in English literature, she is an awardee of the GSE (USA) by Rotary International and the recipient of the Pratibha Samman Award (journalism). Currently working as Professor &amp; HOD Humanities at the ACC Wing, Indian Military Academy, she loves to concoct heady mixes of mystery and emotions."}
