{"url": "https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/41711234.Bj_rn_Schindler", "name": "Bj\u00f8rn Schindler", "genres": ["Fiction", "Fantasy", "Nonfiction"], "avgRating": 4.67, "reviewsCount": 25, "ratingsCount": 79, "about": "Born in 1984, the author began his literary journey in 2014, when he started working on a book intended to unveil the true face of wars and the dirty politics surrounding them. Although this work was never published, the author continued his passion for writing, never forgetting his commitment to real issues.His life path, full of contrasts - from the harsh discipline of the military to the dynamic corporate environment - has become the foundation of his work ethic. Despite professional achievements, a certain void has settled in his life, filled by a deep love for nature and an understanding of what is truly important in life.The author has garnered recognition for both illustrated guides and novels. His oeuvre includes titles like 'The Be Born in 1984, the author began his literary journey in 2014, when he started working on a book intended to unveil the true face of wars and the dirty politics surrounding them. Although this work was never published, the author continued his passion for writing, never forgetting his commitment to real issues.His life path, full of contrasts - from the harsh discipline of the military to the dynamic corporate environment - has become the foundation of his work ethic. Despite professional achievements, a certain void has settled in his life, filled by a deep love for nature and an understanding of what is truly important in life.The author has garnered recognition for both illustrated guides and novels. His oeuvre includes titles like 'The Berserker's Gardens and Forests' (2023), 'Escape the Matrix: A Guide to Living Free in a System-Driven World' (2023), 'AI - Ukjent Fremtid' (2023), and the latest 'KODEN' (2023/2024). His style, shaped by influences from masters like Arthur C. Clarke, Isaac Asimov, Stephen King, Stanislaw Lem, and Andrzej Sapkowski, combines authenticity and harmony with the natural world.With a deep passion for exploring the future and understanding its potential threats, the author creates realistic scenarios in his science fiction novels. His work is not just a product of imagination but also a well-thought reflection on possible future events, grounded in reality.His main goal is to create books that reflect his own values and experiences, while also serving as an inspiration to others. His works provoke critical thinking about the world around us and the potential paths humanity might take. ...more"}
