{"url": "https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/310364.Lisa_Ann_Sandell", "name": "Lisa Ann Sandell", "genres": ["Young Adult", "Poetry", "Historical Fiction"], "avgRating": 3.89, "reviewsCount": 2632, "ratingsCount": 21518, "about": "I was born and raised in Wilmington, Delaware, where I'm told that I was forever buried in books. I began scribbling my own short stories in a spiral bound notebook when I was six. Books and writing were--and still are--a haven for me, and I count myself so lucky that I have a chance to share my stories with others. I currently live and work in New York City where, when I'm not writing, I'm riding my bike, taking a sculpting class, or playing with my dog, Molly. I was born and raised in Wilmington, Delaware, where I'm told that I was forever buried in books. I began scribbling my own short stories in a spiral bound notebook when I was six. Books and writing were--and still are--a haven for me, and I count myself so lucky that I have a chance to share my stories with others. I currently live and work in New York City where, when I'm not writing, I'm riding my bike, taking a sculpting class, or playing with my dog, Molly. ...more"}
