eaks six languages fluently including Danish, Swedish and German and writes full-time while doing a course in Creative Writing at the University of Surrey.\"Book blog:www.shadowislands.comI have a blog:http://www.shadowislands.com/ya-ficti...and a Facebook:https://www.facebook.com/Farah-Cook-A...and a Twitter:www.twitter.com/authorfarahPlease sign up for my newsletter to hear the latest news about my upcoming books:http://eepurl.com/csUdoj ...more"}
