{"url": "https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/8436186.M_J_Thompson", "name": "M.J. Thompson", "avgRating": 3.54, "reviewsCount": 77, "ratingsCount": 858, "about": "Born in Lincoln, England in 1985, M J Thompson now aged twenty nine, is the third born child of her mother's and forth of her father's. With four older siblings, three sister and one brother and four younger, again three sister and one brother, she was never short of company.Growing up she went through many phase's, including to want to be a mechanic, a historian and a midwife. Her only constant dream was of becoming a published author.In school her favorite lesson was always English literature. Always creative she was often praised for her story telling in school and often spent time when she time with her friends and siblings sharing her stories.After finishing school she spent her time traveling around England.Marrying her long term part Born in Lincoln, England in 1985, M J Thompson now aged twenty nine, is the third born child of her mother's and forth of her father's. With four older siblings, three sister and one brother and four younger, again three sister and one brother, she was never short of company.Growing up she went through many phase's, including to want to be a mechanic, a historian and a midwife. Her only constant dream was of becoming a published author.In school her favorite lesson was always English literature. Always creative she was often praised for her story telling in school and often spent time when she time with her friends and siblings sharing her stories.After finishing school she spent her time traveling around England.Marrying her long term partner Pawel in December 2011, he always encouraged her writing and helped with proof reading when needed.Around the same time she discovered a the website Wattpad, a large community of readers and writers. With many idea's for stories and often getting inspired by the slighted thing this was a good place for her to publish her works for millions to read and also read which is one of her favorite past times.Her other past times include watching Korean, Japanese drama's, movies, Anime and reading Manga comic's, some of which inspired some of her writings.She also enjoys playing video games, walking and spending time with her family, friends and pets.Her reading also inspired her youngest sister to read and publish stories on the site.On this site is where she first was approached by a publicist to publish one of her stories to a wider audience. ...more"}
