{"url": "https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/5342951.Jeanne_Ryan", "name": "Jeanne Ryan", "genres": ["Young Adult", "Mystery & Thrillers"], "avgRating": 3.32, "reviewsCount": 3889, "ratingsCount": 29257, "about": "I\u2019ve lived all over the world, raised in a family with eleven brothers and sisters. I spent my early childhood in Hawaii and the rest of my growing-up years trying to figure out a way to get back there, with stops in South Korea, Michigan and Germany along the way. Before writing fiction, I tried my hand at many things, including war game simulation and youth development research. But I decided it was much more fun to work on stories than statistics. These days, I still love Hawaii, but have found my home under the moody skies of the Pacific Northwest.Note, I post news on Twitter @Jeanne_Ryan and on my FB page: www.facebook.com/JeanneRyanAuthor I\u2019ve lived all over the world, raised in a family with eleven brothers and sisters. I spent my early childhood in Hawaii and the rest of my growing-up years trying to figure out a way to get back there, with stops in South Korea, Michigan and Germany along the way. Before writing fiction, I tried my hand at many things, including war game simulation and youth development research. But I decided it was much more fun to work on stories than statistics. These days, I still love Hawaii, but have found my home under the moody skies of the Pacific Northwest.Note, I post news on Twitter @Jeanne_Ryan and on my FB page: www.facebook.com/JeanneRyanAuthor ...more"}
