{"url": "https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/14104736.Hope_Jahren", "name": "Hope Jahren", "genres": ["Science", "Historical Fiction", "Nonfiction"], "avgRating": 4.0, "reviewsCount": 10200, "ratingsCount": 75208, "about": "HOPE JAHREN is a teacher, scientist, and book lover living in Oslo, Norway. Recognized as one Time magazine\u2019s 100 Most Influential People, Jahren is the recipient of three Fulbright Awards and was named one of the Brilliant 10 by Popular Science magazine in 2005. She is the author of two works of nonfiction: The Story of More and Lab Girl, winner of the National Book Critics Circle Award for autobiography. Adventures of Mary Jane is her first work of fiction."}
