{"url": "https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/6455676.Sybrina_Durant", "name": "Sybrina Durant", "genres": ["Children's", "Fantasy", "Self Help"], "avgRating": 4.38, "reviewsCount": 384, "ratingsCount": 1023, "about": "Hi:I am the author of many different types of books. Some are technical and others are fanciful. Illustrated books are my favorite. I believe that you can capture a reader\u2019s attention with a good story but amazing artwork will reel them in and keep them riveted. Check out my newest Unicorn Book called Magical Elements of the Periodic Table Presented Alphabetically By The Metal Horn Unicorns. It's Techno-Magical. Boo's Shoes is my last rabbit and fox book and it is a companion to Cleo Can Tie A Bow! Make sure to put it on your bookshelf so that you'll have it handy when you know someone who wants to learn to tie their shoelaces or any other kind of bow.Journey To Osm - The Blue Unicorn's Tale is my first full-length novel. Please look for it Hi:I am the author of many different types of books. Some are technical and others are fanciful. Illustrated books are my favorite. I believe that you can capture a reader\u2019s attention with a good story but amazing artwork will reel them in and keep them riveted. Check out my newest Unicorn Book called Magical Elements of the Periodic Table Presented Alphabetically By The Metal Horn Unicorns. It's Techno-Magical. Boo's Shoes is my last rabbit and fox book and it is a companion to Cleo Can Tie A Bow! Make sure to put it on your bookshelf so that you'll have it handy when you know someone who wants to learn to tie their shoelaces or any other kind of bow.Journey To Osm - The Blue Unicorn's Tale is my first full-length novel. Please look for it on these Goodreads Listopia lists and give it a vote up on a few of them. https://www.goodreads.com/list/book/4... Please look for \"The Blue Unicorn's Journey To Osm Illustrated Book For Teens and Older Readers\" on this Goodreads Listopia. https://www.goodreads.com/