{"url": "https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/63659.Barbara_Erskine", "name": "Barbara Erskine", "birthDate": "1944-08-10 00:00:00", "genres": ["Literature & Fiction", "Historical Fiction"], "avgRating": 4.09, "reviewsCount": 3816, "ratingsCount": 52761, "about": "An historian by training, Barbara Erskine is the author of six bestselling novels that demonstrate her interest in both history and the supernatural, plus two collections of short stories. Her books have appeared in at least twenty different languages. She lives with her family in an ancient manor house near Colchester, and in a cottage near Hay-on-Wye."}
